WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.369
You don't see... but you will.

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:03.971
[CACKLES]

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:04.738
[MUFFLED SCREAM]

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.876
♪♪

00:00:09.076 --> 00:00:12.679
The reason I said no to you
when you first asked me out...

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.047
Do you want to go to d-dinner
with me?

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:14.948
Mm-mm.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:16.750
...and the six times after
that...

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.851
 -Hey!
-No.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.119
No. No.

00:00:19.553 --> 00:00:21.088
...is because I'm moving to
Brazil.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:24.524
♪♪

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.562
-When I got there...
-Mm.

00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:29.630
...there was a lake there, a
lagoon.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.066
They told me not to go, but...

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:38.071
I didn't listen.

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:45.112
She told me I had three wishes.

00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:48.081
[INTENSE RHYTHMIC BREATHING]

00:00:48.582 --> 00:00:52.452
[EMMA]: When it falls off my
wrist, 
those three wishes will come true.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:54.488
[CACKLES]

00:00:54.488 --> 00:00:57.457
-Do not cut it.
-[CHUCKLES]

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.059
[LAUGHS]

00:01:00.227 --> 00:01:06.233
Emma, with me... all three of
your wishes will come true.

00:01:10.304 --> 00:01:12.639
♪♪

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:13.574
[KNOCKING AT DOOR]

00:01:13.574 --> 00:01:15.776
[MAN]: Would you even know...

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:18.679
[KNOCKING CONTINUES]

00:01:18.679 --> 00:01:20.180
[MAN]: ...if you crossed
into a fairy tale?

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:24.451
[KNOCKING CONTINUES]

00:01:24.952 --> 00:01:25.986
[WOMAN]: A storm is coming.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.255
[MAN]: There are portals in this
world

00:01:29.957 --> 00:01:32.092
that we may never know we've
trespassed through.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.996
♪♪

00:01:41.368 --> 00:01:43.270
[CLOCK TICKING]

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:46.273
I need to know where my wife is.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.611
People... don't just disappear!

00:01:55.382 --> 00:01:56.616
Witches?

00:01:57.017 --> 00:02:00.620
♪♪

00:02:01.455 --> 00:02:05.859
You don't see... but you will.

00:02:06.293 --> 00:02:10.230
♪♪

